[{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"爱君濯濯儒林秀，每日趋朝得共行。\n邻舍不嫌来往数，暂时相送复相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3395,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"试问秋曹张主事，公庭几日未曾行。\n寻常饱饭焚香坐，客至何因简送迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3396,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送族孙继赴温县教谕 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"吾家前代三登仕，今喜孙枝有凤毛。\n但保岁寒冰雪操，会看青步綵云高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3397,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送族孙继赴温县教谕 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"一官典教河南去，持赠东风碧玉枝。\n正好盛年崇德业，日吟卫武切嗟诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3398,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题菜","author":"杨士奇","text":"滥食大官三十载，济人馑岁一毫无。\n园畦过雨青青茂，但爱时和似画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3399,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹寄刘郁武","author":"杨士奇","text":"不见刘伶三十载，白沙翠竹有馀清。\n几时鹅鼻峰头去，共酌流霞看晚晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3400,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"翠岫青林二月春，风光潋滟绛桃新。\n何人独解无尘事，茅舍山中访隐沦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3401,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"无人六月不愁暑，二子水亭萧爽同。\n林影溪光坐终日，何须醉引碧荷筒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3402,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"雨后参差锦树明，碧云楼阁丽秋晴。\n扁舟閒恋溪亭净，已胜山阴雪夜行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3403,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杨学士画 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"十日河流冻不潮，连山一带玉岧峣。\n不嫌寒气侵人骨，独解骑驴学灞桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3404,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉峡山人","author":"杨士奇","text":"归住江南烟水村，诗书稼穑付儿孙。\n老夫閒日浑无事，但祝南山荅主恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3405,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溧阳史侯祠庙图 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"水色山光明栋宇，溧阳独有故侯祠。\n犹闻邑里怀遗爱，况是云仍切孝思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3406,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溧阳史侯祠庙图 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"千岁祠堂脩荐谒，四时宗族会杯盘。\n建宁太守家园乐，写向丹山碧水看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3407,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王文英典籍致仕归金华 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"金马玉堂供奉久，石渠天禄校雠多。\n从来报主丹心切，无那衰迟白发何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3408,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王文英典籍致仕归金华 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"天恩初下许辞官，拜别金銮晓出关。\n应到牧羊山下望，青云何似白云閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3409,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王文英典籍致仕归金华 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"都门垂柳绿毵毵，风捲飞花送别骖。\n归去光荣照闾里，姓名犹载旧官衔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3410,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王文英典籍致仕归金华 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"翰苑同官二十春，况兼同舍更情亲。\n分携莫学浮云散，时有音书慰故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3411,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅与江阴周生 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"一树葳蕤蔼素云，水边林畔不胜春。\n周家旧爱莲花好，添著梅花清十分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3412,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅与江阴周生 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"潇洒清姿玉雪寒，莫教横笛近阑干。\n金樽檀板难相称，正好江阴道院看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3413,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水赠宾畿弟南归 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔年武姥山前住，翠巘丹崖映荜扉。\n回首云山渺天末，独题幽思送将归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3414,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水赠宾畿弟南归 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"盘古青山似画图，新栽松柏近何如。\n几时同向云林住，相伴春秋洒饭盂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3415,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅送吴野知县 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"折赠罗浮枝上雪，鲜葩芳蕊净无瑕。\n清于彭泽门前柳，不比河阳县里花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3416,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅送吴野知县 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"西昌县令辞官后，归住延陵季子州。\n好觅孤山林处士，看花携取鹤同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3417,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄两王詹事周庶子李钱两学士黎谕德兼致谢意 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"老托藜筇与竹舆，关山千里从龙车。\n五年重过头成雪，料得山灵也笑渠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3418,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄两王詹事周庶子李钱两学士黎谕德兼致谢意 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"扈从巡边愧不才，玉堂临别屡浮杯。\n行装更比人人重，为得明珠六斛来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3419,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白河 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"奉天靖难封功日，亲见文皇语白河。\n欲渡未能冰遽合，万人欢忭比滹沱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3420,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白河 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"六御后来重驻辇，裴徊追悯阵亡魂。\n至今河上千年石，文字辉煌纪圣恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3421,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"春到人间夜不寒，银灯金烛映华阑。\n太平处处清光好，第一蓬莱顶上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3422,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"九衢敕放金吾禁，夹道连延宝炬红。\n仰听仙韶天上奏，君王正在广寒宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3423,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"鸾应琼笙凤应歌，光涵太液贯银河。\n吾皇岁岁升平乐，今岁升平乐更多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3424,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"冰泮龙池春似海，玉凫金雁绕红莲。\n人生何幸雍熙世，共乐光明不夜天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3425,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其五","author":"杨士奇","text":"彩霞摇漾宝书浓，八极飞仙总会同。\n鳌载蓬壶来海上，天移星斗下云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3426,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其六","author":"杨士奇","text":"佛国摩尼三万斛，随春先到凤凰城。\n红楼紫殿光辉满，还照山河大地明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3427,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其七","author":"杨士奇","text":"花拥鳌峰锦簇棚，蟾光须让九华灯。\n君王宴坐芙蓉殿，万岁欢声涌颂声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3428,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其八","author":"杨士奇","text":"百万红蕖一夜开，煇煌元圃彻蓬莱。\n岂如圣主光明德，洞达乾坤照九垓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3429,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其九","author":"杨士奇","text":"千岁仙桃进御筵，华缸春蔼御楼前。\n圣皇一念同民乐，九域欢谣彻九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3430,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕观灯诗 其十","author":"杨士奇","text":"大明一统御乾坤，雨露生成总帝恩。\n宣德年年调玉烛，华夷长戴圣皇尊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3431,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石寄赠司训陈仲仁 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"文范远孙同里闬，都门分手又经年。\n九峰三泖多才俊，想见洋洋蔼诵弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3432,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题枯木竹石寄赠司训陈仲仁 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"南望三吴有所思，羡渠淞上拥皋比。\n故乡一片山林趣，写寄高斋慰别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3433,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月八日史馆困睡梦侍献陵顾问虏事觉而感赋","author":"杨士奇","text":"至德仁心在万方，一思往事一情伤。\n自从龙驾归仙后，云净天高望渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3434,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送邢侍讲归无为 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"永乐年中擢殿元，胪传第一拜金銮。\n五云东畔蓬莱阁，浩荡身沾四圣恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3435,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送邢侍讲归无为 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"一枝苍玉赠卿行，不尽同官缱绻情。\n知有乡人候归旆，夜来南斗避文星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3436,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅赠刘伯埙南行 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"都阃边南控百蛮，只今椎髻学衣冠。\n春风绿幕文书简，雪蕊冰花正好看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3437,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅赠刘伯埙南行 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"城瞰昆明池水滨，碧鸡山色日相亲。\n也知不忘乡关意，时对梅花想故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3438,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江西副使梅 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"江西宪副河南后，白简飞霜秉至公。\n一段梅花贞洁操，肯随桃李媚东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3439,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江西副使梅 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"花比琼瑶根比石，广平更是铁心肝。\n西山南浦无尘地，最好柏台相对看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3440,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何布政致仕东归 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"三载西江惠泽深，勤民深体九重心。\n遽看请老投簪去，画省空馀棠树阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3441,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何布政致仕东归 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"心事从来不愧天，操持金石信同坚。\n山光水色青云外，归傍东吴作散仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3442,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孙佥事云山图 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"九叠匡庐霄汉表，白云深护翠巑岏。\n绣衣使者经行处，写向霜台柏署看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3443,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孙佥事云山图 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"山光云彩净无尘，往往衡茅著隐沦。\n万一隆中有王佐，时停四牡一咨询。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3444,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅送校官赴岭南 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"一命微官万里程，讲筵清对鲁诸生。\n春风到日人应到，赢得梅花满路迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3445,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅送校官赴岭南 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"南度梅关第一州，之官偏称少时游。\n过家喜拜双亲健，莫遣王程久滞留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3446,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄余正安 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"不归无补乞归难，白发萧疏不耐寒。\n又办肩舆扶老病，将随翠辇渡桑乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3447,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄余正安 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"银河飞泻石梁清，日照屏风九叠明。\n谁似匡南余侍讲，仰高台上看云生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3448,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黎谕德以梅花索题赠乃侄归 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"柏台御史当涂守，清贮胸中万斛春。\n昨日挥毫写林雪，玉堂留赠岁寒人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3449,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黎谕德以梅花索题赠乃侄归 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"竹林二阮共襟期，晏岁京华怆别离。\n归到南州倚琼树，定因驿使寄相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3450,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梅寄襄城李公","author":"杨士奇","text":"第一梅花擅早春，冰为肌骨雪为神。\n江南何处看尤好，锦帐牙旗伴玉人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3451,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题剑送别","author":"杨士奇","text":"屡勤王事效驱驰，历遍辽东与蜀西。\n兹行解赠龙泉剑，会看功名华岳齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3452,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹送胡轸敬同","author":"杨士奇","text":"二十年中屡别离，冰霜不改岁寒姿。\n于今浙水东西畔，潇洒清风见一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3453,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画寄王行敏 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"王氏南园嘉菊盛，年来分植过兰塘。\n塘上萧閒六十叟，坐对秋风晚节香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3454,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画寄王行敏 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"兰塘秋清黄菊开，兰塘隐者日衔杯。\n酒酣若忆京华客，定寄兰塘香秫来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3455,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐善老友辞官南归题梅奉赠 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"解印南归江上家，文明门外发轻车。\n到时渐及新年节，閒玩园林雪后花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3456,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乐善老友辞官南归题梅奉赠 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"离乡三十四回春，遥忆梅花岁岁新。\n君到乡园若相忆，折花还寄北京人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3457,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过三河县 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"满县柴扉半不开，纷纷车马动浮埃。\n连延粉壁题官户，尽属风云感会来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3458,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过三河县 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"城中庐舍半编茅，郭外园畦尽种匏。\n白发当门坐沽酒，红裙作阵出提筲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3459,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日度喜峰口次杨太常韵二首 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"马首连朝东复东，穿云蹑石与君同。\n须知第一人间险，未数鱼凫蜀道中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3460,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日度喜峰口次杨太常韵二首 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"飞涧悬崖百折东，跻攀无处不相同。\n他年九日萸觞畔，能忘今晨此路中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3461,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其一 正月十三日大祀天地先日车驾夙兴径诣南郊躬历神厨遍阅祭品申饬太常务精诚意是夕有司请如故事放烟火上曰朕方严对越岂暇嬉事敕免之已而阴云微布瑞雪纷集行事之际天气融和月星皎洁云飙净敛肃如神临此上天昭答圣敬也为敬天之诗第一","author":"杨士奇","text":"泰坛吉日奉明烟，肃肃宸衷秉至纯。\n天遣瑶华昭景贶，旋开云翳粲星文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3462,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其二 皇上奉圣母皇太后极天下之养爱敬之至深得欢心此圣人治道之本也为圣孝之诗第二","author":"杨士奇","text":"九重孝德超前古，日日承欢在宝慈。\n圣母圣皇天所祐，太平至乐万年期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3463,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其三 比岁屡命廷臣举贤荐能选任方面守令以安黎庶又命法司矜恤刑狱务从宽典此生民所由安也为安民之诗第三","author":"杨士奇","text":"元恺登庸比舜功，恤民爱物禹汤同。\n九州四海涵恩泽，都在阳和化育中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3464,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其四 连岁敕令有司蠲，除逋负振恤荒歉。此帝王之仁政也，为敷仁之诗第四","author":"杨士奇","text":"蠲逋赈乏自皇仁，紫凤衔书岁岁新。\n雨露洋洋被遐迩，乾坤万物总皆春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3465,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其五 今岁元正天下方岳及郡县之臣皆述职来朝廷臣劾奏其中有怠职隳事者请论如法德音诞敷悉见释免欢呼万岁声振门庭为肆宥之诗第五","author":"杨士奇","text":"万国来朝会缙绅，除愆宥过赐更新。\n欢声好似春雷震，一片嵩呼彻紫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3466,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 其六 先岁之冬瑞雪屡降履端以始讫于上旬天宇澄明霁景融丽此大有之祥圣德所召也为兆丰年之诗第六","author":"杨士奇","text":"三雪为祥表腊前，融融嘉气集新年。\n太平有兆人人说，圣德中和格上天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3467,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太平圣德诗十章 皇上以年谷屡丰四境宁谧每于岁首敕群臣百姓自正旦至元夕皆饮酒为乐市中如故事张灯五城弛夜禁仍赐戒敕各循礼度此与众同乐之大恩也为推恩之诗第七 其七","author":"杨士奇","text":"元旦年年颁宝敕，乐同文武及黔黎。\n金吾五夜皆无禁，饮酒为欢慎礼仪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":3468,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]